  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water. Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Cook potato in the boiling water, over high heat, until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 minutes. Drain and return to the pan.\n• Add the butter (for the mash) and milk to potato and season generously with salt. Mash until smooth. TIP: Save time and get more fibre by leaving the potato unpeeled.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/639a7f9c50c0a56c47002576/step-02ce30a7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, finely chop garlic. Grate carrot. Drain and rinse chickpeas.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/639a7f9c50c0a56c47002576/step-c4d5b106.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to high. In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot, until tender, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add Mumbai spice blend, tomato paste, mild curry paste, chickpeas and garlic and cook, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Stir in coconut milk, vegetable stock powder, the butter (for the curry), brown sugar and water, until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/639a7f9c50c0a56c47002576/step-86248e0e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer chickpea filling to medium baking dish. Spread mash potato over the top. Sprinkle with shredded Cheddar cheese.\n• Grill until cheese is melted, 8-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/639a7f9c50c0a56c47002576/step-d01bdd6b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato.\n• In a large bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, tomato, a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/639a7f9c50c0a56c47002576/step-fcd96c65.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide Mumbai chickpea & cheddar pie and tomato salad between plates to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/639a7f9c50c0a56c47002576/step-196fe0f8.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
